notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T11:08:33.042Z",codex,Implementation remains independently merge and publication blocked by pm-web-priv and GitHub issue #96 even if code and CI turn green.
  "2026-08-21T11:41:28.575Z",codex,"The first packed run failed because web status emitted its own JSON and returned an ordinary structured value,causing the pm host to append a second JSON document. The production fix uses the installed public SDK suppressHostOutput primitive for status,stop,and doctor through one tested shared output owner; packed npx and bunx now each return exactly one parseable document."
